  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting UNICEF to reduce acute malnutrition and prevent mortality in severely malnourished children while strengthening national systems, coordination and resilience in emergency-affected areas of the Sahel.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Supporting UNICEF to reduce acute malnutrition and prevent mortality in severely malnourished children while strengthening national systems, coordination and resilience in emergency-affected areas of the Sahel. is a component of Sahel Humanitarian Emergency Response Programme  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;53,320,103. This project benefits South of Sahara, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services.</narrative>
  </description>
